IMPORT `doga-owner`

-- Dog Act 1976 (WA) and Dog Regulations 2013 -- the dog owner's questions, worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case.
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table (scratchpad gen_wa_dog-act-1976_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.
--
-- Facts from the WA lives (workbench scenarios au/wa/cradle-to-grave-chloe): c075, 8 March 2035, Chloe and Liam take
-- Mochi home from the shelter and register her with the shire. The scenario does not give Mochi's age, breed or papers;
-- ASSUMED here: an adult (24 months), not a restricted breed, sterilised with a vet's certificate, microchipped by the
-- shelter, never registered; Chloe is not a pensioner; Byford is in the metropolitan region and a townsite. Every other
-- dog is the encoder's illustration, not a scenario event.

