§ `s 3 -- is my dog a dangerous dog`

#ASSERT NOT `Is my dog a dangerous dog` `Mochi`
#ASSERT `Is my dog a dangerous dog` `a pit bull cross`
#ASSERT `Is my dog a dangerous dog` `a guard dog`

§ `s 7 -- must I register my dog`

-- c075: once Mochi is Chloe's, she must be registered with the Shire; while the shelter held her, she need not be.
#ASSERT `Must I register my dog` `Mochi` EQUALS `yes: register it with the local government of the district where it is ordinarily kept (ss 7(1), 16(1))`
#ASSERT `Must I register my dog` `Mochi at the shelter` EQUALS `no: not while a shelter, vet or official holds it (s 7(3)(b), (c))`
#ASSERT `Must I register my dog` `a puppy` EQUALS `no: it is under 3 months old (s 7(3)(a))`
#ASSERT `Must I register my dog` `an interstate-registered dog` EQUALS `no: it is already registered under this Act or another State's or Territory's law (s 7(1))`

#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for an unregistered dog` `Mochi` EQUALS 5000

#ASSERT `What is the infringement amount for an unregistered dog` `a declared dog` EQUALS 400

§ `s 16(3), (3A) -- can the shire refuse to register my dog`

#ASSERT `Can the shire refuse to register my dog` `Mochi` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no ground in s 16(3): the registration officer is to register it (s 16(2)(a))`
#ASSERT `Can the shire refuse to register my dog` `a pit bull cross` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `it may refuse, if the local government so directs; it must give me written grounds and I may seek SAT review (ss 16(3), (4), 17(1))`
#ASSERT `Can the shire refuse to register my dog` `Mochi` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `it must refuse: I am banned from owning or keeping a dog by an order under s 46A(2) (s 16(3A))`

§ `s 15 and r 17 -- how much is the registration fee`

-- c075: Mochi, sterilised with proof, registered from 8 March 2035: $20 for a year, $42.50 for 3 years, $100 for life.
#ASSERT `How much is the registration fee` `Mochi` FALSE `one year` TRUE (Date 8 3 2035) 0 EQUALS (`the fee in dollars is` 20)
#ASSERT `How much is the registration fee` `Mochi` FALSE `three years` TRUE (Date 8 3 2035) 0 EQUALS (`the fee in dollars is` 42.5)
#ASSERT `How much is the registration fee` `Mochi` FALSE `lifetime` TRUE (Date 8 3 2035) 0 EQUALS (`the fee in dollars is` 100)
#ASSERT `How much is the registration fee` `an unsterilised dog` FALSE `one year` TRUE (Date 8 3 2035) 0 EQUALS (`the fee in dollars is` 50)
#ASSERT `How much is the registration fee` `a sterilised dog without proof` FALSE `one year` TRUE (Date 8 3 2035) 0 EQUALS (`the fee in dollars is` 50)
#ASSERT `How much is the registration fee` `Mochi` FALSE `one year` TRUE (Date 1 7 2035) 0 EQUALS (`the fee in dollars is` 10)
#ASSERT `How much is the registration fee` `a stock dog` FALSE `one year` FALSE (Date 8 3 2035) 0 EQUALS (`the fee in dollars is` 12.5)
#ASSERT `How much is the registration fee` `a pit bull cross` TRUE `one year` TRUE (Date 8 3 2035) 10 EQUALS (`the fee in dollars is` 50)
#ASSERT `How much is the registration fee` `a pit bull cross` FALSE `lifetime` TRUE (Date 8 3 2035) 0 EQUALS `not available: a dangerous dog is registered only to the next 31 October (s 15(3A))`
#ASSERT `How much is the registration fee` `an assistance dog` FALSE `one year` TRUE (Date 8 3 2035) 0 EQUALS `no fee: an assistance dog (s 15(4))`

§ `s 15(2) -- when does my dog's registration end`

-- c075: a one-year registration from 8 March 2035 ends on 31 October 2035; 3 years ends on 31 October 2038.
#ASSERT `When does my dog's registration end` `Mochi` `one year` (Date 8 3 2035) EQUALS (`it ends on` (Date 31 10 2035))
#ASSERT `When does my dog's registration end` `Mochi` `three years` (Date 8 3 2035) EQUALS (`it ends on` (Date 31 10 2038))
#ASSERT `When does my dog's registration end` `Mochi` `one year` (Date 15 11 2035) EQUALS (`it ends on` (Date 31 10 2036))

§ `r 19 -- my refund if I sterilise my dog later`

#ASSERT `What refund do I get for sterilising my dog` `an unsterilised dog` FALSE `one year` 50 1 EQUALS 30
#ASSERT `What refund do I get for sterilising my dog` `an unsterilised dog` FALSE `three years` 120 2 EQUALS (155 DIVIDED BY 3)
#ASSERT `What refund do I get for sterilising my dog` `an unsterilised dog` FALSE `lifetime` 250 4 EQUALS 0

§ `ss 21-23 -- microchipping`

-- c075: Mochi is over 3 months, so she must be microchipped; the shelter has done it, so there is no breach.
#ASSERT `Must my dog be microchipped` `Mochi` FALSE EQUALS `yes (s 21(2))`
#ASSERT `Must my dog be microchipped` `a puppy` FALSE EQUALS `no: it is under 3 months old (ss 21(2), 22(2))`
#ASSERT `Must my dog be microchipped` `a declared dog` TRUE EQUALS `yes (s 21(2)); s 22(2) is suspended during the s 22(3) period`
#ASSERT `Must my dog be microchipped` `a declared dog` FALSE EQUALS `yes: a dangerous dog (ss 21(2), 22(2))`

#ASSERT `Am I in breach of the microchipping duty` `an unchipped adult dog` FALSE

#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for not microchipping` `a declared dog` FALSE EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for not microchipping` `a declared dog` TRUE EQUALS 5000

-- c075: Mochi's microchip details go with the registration application, so no separate notice.
#ASSERT `By when must I give the microchip details` (Date 1 3 2035) TRUE EQUALS `no separate notice: the details go with the registration application (s 23(2))`
#ASSERT `By when must I give the microchip details` (Date 28 3 2035) FALSE EQUALS (`give the local government written notice by` (Date 4 4 2035))

§ `ss 30-32 -- in a public place`

-- c075 (illustration): Mochi walked in a Byford street, then at a dog exercise area.
#ASSERT `Is my dog lawfully in this public place` `Mochi` `an ordinary public place` TRUE TRUE `held on a leash by a person able to control it` 1.5 FALSE EQUALS `lawful (s 31(1))`
#ASSERT `Is my dog lawfully in this public place` `Mochi` `an ordinary public place` TRUE TRUE `off the leash and unsupervised` 1.5 FALSE EQUALS `offence under s 31(3): a fine of up to $5 000, unless I took all reasonable precautions (s 33B)`
#ASSERT `Is my dog lawfully in this public place` `Mochi` `an ordinary public place` TRUE TRUE `held on a leash by a person able to control it` 3 FALSE EQUALS `offence under s 31(3): a fine of up to $5 000, unless I took all reasonable precautions (s 33B)`
#ASSERT `Is my dog lawfully in this public place` `Mochi` `a dog exercise area` TRUE TRUE `off the leash, supervised close by a competent person carrying a leash` 1.5 FALSE EQUALS `lawful: held, tethered or competently supervised in an exercise area or rural place (s 32(1))`
#ASSERT `Is my dog lawfully in this public place` `Mochi` `a dog exercise area` TRUE TRUE `off the leash and unsupervised` 1.5 FALSE EQUALS `offence under s 32(4): a fine of up to $5 000, unless I took all reasonable precautions (s 33B)`
#ASSERT `Is my dog lawfully in this public place` `Mochi` `a public place where the local government prohibits dogs at this time` TRUE TRUE `held on a leash by a person able to control it` 1.5 FALSE EQUALS `offence under s 31(3): a fine of up to $5 000, unless I took all reasonable precautions (s 33B)`
#ASSERT `Is my dog lawfully in this public place` `a pit bull cross` `an ordinary public place` TRUE TRUE `held on a leash by a person able to control it` 1.5 FALSE EQUALS `not encoded: a dangerous dog is controlled under s 33GA`

#ASSERT `Must my dog wear its registration tag in public` `Mochi` FALSE

§ `ss 33E, 33F -- dangerous dog declarations`

#ASSERT `Can my dog be declared dangerous` `an unprovoked attack that caused injury or damage` EQUALS `yes, if the local government or its authorised person is of the opinion that this is so (s 33E(1))`
#ASSERT `Can my dog be declared dangerous` `an attack that was an immediate response to provocation` EQUALS `no: behaviour induced by provocation is not an attack (s 3(1))`

#ASSERT `By when must I object to the declaration` (Date 1 5 2036) EQUALS (Date 8 5 2036)

#ASSERT `When does the declaration take effect` (Date 28 12 2036) EQUALS (Date 4 1 2037)

